body:
Hi {{first_name}},

Your UCAS application for {{cycle_year}} entry has been submitted. From this point on, the universities you applied to can see it, so please read the details below and tell us straight away if anything is wrong.

  Submitted on  : {{submitted_at}}
  Cycle         : {{cycle_year}}
  UCAS ID       : {{ucas_id}}
  Choices sent  : {{n_choices}} of {{max_choices}}

Your choices
------------
{{choices_block}}

What happens next
-----------------
  - Sign in to UCAS Track (track.ucas.com) — your application will appear there and every decision lands on that dashboard.
  - Universities reply in their own time. Some come back within days, others take months, and the order they reply in means nothing.
  - When all your decisions are in, you choose one Firm and one Insurance reply. Your tutor and the careers team will help you weigh them up.
  - Keep working: most offers you receive will be conditional on your final grades.

If anything above is wrong — a course, a university, the UCAS ID — reply to this email or contact us at {{contact_email}} as soon as you can.

Good luck.

The UCAS Team
{{system_name}}
